#: index
msgid "Swajp – Anax Keyboard"
msgstr "Swajp – Anax Keyboard"

#: index
msgid "A keyboard<br><em>fit for an emperor.</em>"
msgstr "Papan kekunci<br><em>yang layak untuk maharaja.</em>"

#: index
msgid "Swift as Anax – the emperor dragonfly.<br>Precise as its hunt."
msgstr "Pantas seperti Anax – pepatung maharaja.<br>Tepat seperti buruannya."

#: index
msgid ""
"<strong class=\"story\">Inspired by Swype. Born as Swajp.</strong> An Android keyboard you type on with a glide of your finger. It guesses words from context, learns your style, and all your data stays on your phone."
msgstr ""
"<strong class=\"story\">Diilhamkan oleh Swype. Lahir sebagai Swajp.</strong> Papan kekunci Android yang membolehkan anda menaip dengan leretan jari. Ia meneka perkataan berdasarkan konteks, mempelajari gaya anda, dan semua data anda kekal dalam telefon anda."

#: index
msgid "Get it on Google Play"
msgstr "Dapatkannya di Google Play"

